  <Placemark>
   <name>Gale Warning issued September 26 at 2:22PM EDT until September 27 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Caribou ME</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_moderate</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 40 kt and
seas 8 to 12 ft.

* WHERE...Waters from Eastport ME to Schoodic Point ME from 25
to 60 NM or the Hague Line and Waters from Schoodic Point ME
to Stonington ME from 25 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
