   <name>Storm Warning issued September 26 at 2:21PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Upton NY</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_severe</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Northeast winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 55 kt. Seas
5 to 8 feet for parts of Gardiners Bay and Eastern Long Island
Sound.

* WHERE...Long Island Sound east of Port Jefferson and New
Haven, Peconic and Gardiners Bays, and South Shore Bays from
Jones Inlet through Shinnecock Bay.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
