   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Steep seas 6 to 8 feet at 8 to 9 seconds this morning.
North winds increasing to 15 to 25 kt this afternoon and evening
and again Sunday afternoon and evening. Steep wind seas of 6 to
8 feet at 6 to 7 seconds.

* WHERE...All waters north of Cape Blanco.

* WHEN...Until 11 PM PDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds and/or steep seas could capsize or
damage smaller vessels.

* View the hazard area in detail at https://go.usa.gov/x6hks</Snippet>
